                                                "sense_id": "a8db7173-be0c-3c80-a999-1b2592144222",
                                                "text": "They were pleased because he was not above drinking a cup of tea with them, and when the dawn came and they were still waiting they offered him a slice of bread and dripping; he was not squeamish and could eat most things now with a good appetite."
